UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1 WHERE "slug" IN ('cincinnati', 'st-louis', 'indianapolis', 'pittsburgh');
UPDATE "City" SET "intro" = 'Cincinnati''s listings center on community spaces. The Mayerson JCC holds a weekly Mah-Jongg drop-in, and Mariemont Branch Library offers open play with a short beginner instruction slot beforehand. Mahj with Meg teaches the National Mah Jongg League card and the basics of a full game, and a social evening event at Rookwood pairs open play with mingling. Locations are spread across the metro, so confirm the branch or venue before you go.' WHERE "slug" = 'cincinnati';
UPDATE "City" SET "intro" = 'St. Louis has both a dedicated club and community-run events. Clover Club in Crestwood offers guided tables and open play, while Magpie Mahjong runs lessons and open-play events led by Ali Salter. Other events are held at shops and restaurants around the metro, including Saint Charles and Webster Groves. Guided play is a good first step if you are new, and it is worth checking the venue address before your first visit.' WHERE "slug" = 'st-louis';
UPDATE "City" SET "intro" = 'Central Indiana players have a dedicated center and public-library options. Fishers Mah Jongg Center offers open play and beginner lessons, and Indianapolis Central Library hosts open play and instruction sessions. Jaime Keith teaches lessons and hosts events from a studio in nearby Zionsville. If you are new, a library instruction session or a beginner lesson is a good first step, and Fishers and Zionsville are a short drive from downtown Indianapolis.' WHERE "slug" = 'indianapolis';
UPDATE "City" SET "intro" = 'Pittsburgh''s listings are spread across the city and its suburbs. Cooper-Siegel Community Library in the Fox Chapel area hosts weekly open play, Northern Tier Regional Library and a restaurant group also run open play, and Jane S. teaches around Cranberry Township. Lauri Ann West Community Center offers beginner class series. Because options are scattered, check the location and travel time before your first visit, and a beginner class is a good place to start.' WHERE "slug" = 'pittsburgh';
